TARGET = os.path.normpath(os.path.join(SCRIPT_DIR, "..", "data", "sample", "train.jsonl"))

entries = [
    ("Python 装饰器链（Decorator Chain）是怎么执行的？",
     "**装饰器链**的多个装饰器按从下到上（或从内到外）的顺序应用，但执行时按从外到内。\n\n**示例**：\n```python\ndef bold(func):\n    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n        return f'<b>{func(*args, **kwargs)}</b>'\n    return wrapper\n\ndef italic(func):\n    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n        return f'<i>{func(*args, **kwargs)}</i>'\n    return wrapper\n\n@bold\n@italic\ndef hello():\n    return 'Hello'\n\n# 等价于：\n# hello = bold(italic(hello))\nprint(hello())  # <b><i>Hello</i></b>\n```\n\n**执行顺序**：\n1. `hello = italic(hello)`（原始函数）\n2. `hello = bold(hello)`（italic 包装后的函数）\n3. 调用 hello()：\n   - 进入 bold wrapper\n   - bold 调用 italic（func(*args)）\n   - italic 返回 `<i>Hello</i>`\n   - bold 返回 `<b><i>Hello</i></b>`\n\n**带参数装饰器链**：\n```python\ndef repeat(times):\n    def decorator(func):\n        def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n            results = []\n            for _ in range(times):\n                results.append(func(*args, **kwargs))\n            return results\n        return wrapper\n    return decorator\n\ndef tag(tag_name):\n    def decorator(func):\n        def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n            result = func(*args, **kwargs)\n            return f'<{tag_name}>{result}</{tag_name}>'\n        return wrapper\n    return decorator\n\n@tag('div')\n@repeat(3)\ndef say(name):\n    return f'Hi {name}'\n\n# 等价于：tag('div')(repeat(3)(say)))\n# 执行：repeat(3) -> 3 个 'Hi Alice' -> tag('div') -> <div>Hi Alice</div>...\n```\n\n**类装饰器链**：\n```python\ndef add_method(cls):\n    cls.new_method = lambda self: 'new'\n    return cls\n\ndef modify_init(cls):\n    old_init = cls.__init__\n    def new_init(self, *args, **kwargs):\n        print('before init')\n        old_init(self, *args, **kwargs)\n        print('after init')\n    cls.__init__ = new_init\n    return cls\n\n@add_method\n@modify_init\nclass MyClass:\n    def __init__(self, x):\n        self.x = x\n```\n\n**functools.wraps 在链中的作用**：\n```python\ndef my_decorator(func):\n    @functools.wraps(func)  # 保留 __name__、__doc__\n    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n        return func(*args, **kwargs)\n    return wrapper\n\n# 没有 wraps\n@my_decorator\n@my_decorator\ndef example():\n    '''docstring'''\n    pass\n\nprint(example.__name__)  # 'wrapper'（错的）\n\n# 有 wraps\n# print(example.__name__)  # 'example'（对的）\n```\n\n**生产实践**：\n- 装饰器总是用 functools.wraps\n- 复杂装饰器考虑类实现（可读性）\n- 装饰器链不易调试（加日志）"),
    ("Python 字符串前缀（r, b, u, f）有什么区别？",
     "**Python 字符串前缀**改变字符串的字面量解释方式。\n\n**1. r-string（原始字符串）**：\n```python\n# 不处理转义\npath = r'C:\\Users\\Alice\\file.txt'\nprint(path)  # C:\\Users\\Alice\\file.txt（不转义）\n\n# 仍不能用 r'' 表示 '\\'（必须用 r'\\\\'）\ns = r'\\\\'  # '\\\\'（两个反斜杠）\n```\n\n**2. b-string（bytes）**：\n```python\n# bytes（不是 str）\nb = b'hello'\nprint(b[0])  # 104（int，不是字符 'h'）\nprint(type(b))  # <class 'bytes'>\n\n# 编码/解码\ntext = '你好'.encode('utf-8')  # str → bytes\ntext_back = b'你好'.decode('utf-8')  # bytes → str\n```\n\n**3. u-string（unicode，Python 3 默认）**：\n```python\n# Python 3：所有 str 都是 unicode\n# u'...' 等价于 '...'\ntext1 = u'hello'\ntext2 = 'hello'\nprint(text1 == text2)  # True\n```\n\n**4. f-string（格式化）**：\n```python\nname = 'Alice'\nage = 30\nprint(f'Name: {name}, Age: {age}')\n# Name: Alice, Age: 30\n\n# 表达式\nprint(f'{2 + 3 * 4}')  # 14\n\n# 格式说明符\nimport math\nprint(f'π = {math.pi:.4f}')  # π = 3.1416\nprint(f'{12345:,}')  # 12,345\nprint(f'{0.5:.1%}')  # 50.0%\n\n# 调试（Python 3.8+）\nprint(f'{name=}, {age=}')  # name='Alice', age=30\n```\n\n**5. 组合（部分）**：\n```python\n# rb（原始 bytes）\ndata = rb'binary\\x00data'\n\n# f + b（Python 3.6+，f-string 嵌入 b）\nname = b'Alice'\nprint(f'Name: {name.decode()}')  # Name: Alice\n\n# [X] r + f 无效（Python 3.12 前）\n# fr'hello'  # SyntaxError: invalid string prefix\n\n# [v] Python 3.12+\nprint(fr'\\n')  # \\n（不转义）\n```\n\n**6. 三引号字符串**：\n```python\n# 普通\ntext = '''line 1\nline 2\nline 3'''\n\n# r 保留换行\ntext = r'''line 1\nline 2'''\n```\n\n**实际应用**：\n\n**正则表达式**：\n```python\nimport re\n\n# 必须用 r-string（避免转义灾难）\npattern = r'\\d{3}-\\d{4}'\nre.match(pattern, '123-4567')  # Match\n\n# [X] 不 r-string：需要双反斜杠\npattern = '\\d{3}-\\d{4}'  # 还能工作\npattern2 = '\\\\d{3}-\\\\d{4}'  # 同上但难读\n```\n\n**Windows 路径**：\n```python\n# [v] r-string\npath = r'C:\\Users\\Alice\\file.txt'\n\n# [X] 非 r-string\npath = 'C:\\Users\\Alice\\file.txt'\n# \\U 是 unicode 转义，触发 DeprecationWarning\n```\n\n**SQL 查询**：\n```python\nquery = f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '{name}' AND age > {age}\"\n# [!]️ SQL 注入风险！\n# 用参数化查询：\nquery = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = %s AND age > %s\"\ncursor.execute(query, (name, age))\n```\n\n**生产实践**：\n- 正则/路径：始终用 r-string\n- 字符串模板：用 f-string\n- 二进制：用 b-string\n- SQL：参数化查询（不是 f-string）"),
    ("Python 中如何处理 INI / cfg 配置文件？configparser 模块详解",
     "**configparser** 是 Python 标准库，用于处理 INI 风格配置文件。\n\n**基本 INI 格式**：\n```ini\n# config.ini\n[DEFAULT]\nServerAliveInterval = 45\nCompression = yes\n\n[bitbucket]\nUser = hg\n\n[topsecret]\nServerAliveInterval = 30\nCompression = no\n```\n\n**读取**：\n```python\nimport configparser\n\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser()\nconfig.read('config.ini')\n\n# 访问 section\nconfig['bitbucket']['User']  # 'hg'\n\n# 访问 DEFAULT（所有 section 共享）\nconfig['bitbucket']['ServerAliveInterval']  # 45\n\n# 遍历\nfor section in config.sections():\n    print(f'[{section}]')\n    for key in config[section]:\n        print(f'{key} = {config[section][key]}')\n```\n\n**类型转换**：\n```python\n# getint\nport = config.getint('server', 'port')  # int\n# getfloat\ntimeout = config.getfloat('server', 'timeout')  # float\n# getboolean\ndebug = config.getboolean('server', 'debug')  # bool\n# 注意：true/yes/1/on 都是 True\n```\n\n**默认值**：\n```python\n# 缺失 key 返回默认值\nport = config.getint('server', 'port', fallback=8080)\n```\n\n**DEFAULT section**：\n```ini\n[DEFAULT]\nlog_level = INFO\n\n[server1]\nhost = localhost\n\n[server2]\nhost = example.com\n# 自动继承 DEFAULT：log_level = INFO\n```\n\n**插值（Interpolation）**：\n```ini\n[DEFAULT]\nhome_dir = /Users\n\n[paths]\npictures_dir = %(home_dir)s/Pictures\nphotos_dir = %(pictures_dir)s/Photos\n# 解析为：\n# pictures_dir = /Users/Pictures\n# photos_dir = /Users/Pictures/Photos\n```\n\n**写入**：\n```python\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser()\nconfig['DEFAULT'] = {'debug': 'false'}\nconfig['database'] = {\n    'host': 'localhost',\n    'port': '5432',\n    'name': 'mydb',\n}\n\nwith open('config.ini', 'w') as f:\n    config.write(f)\n```\n\n**保留大小写**：\n```ini\n[Section]\nKey = Value\n```\n\n```python\n# 默认小写化（optionxform）\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser()\nconfig.read('config.ini')\nprint(config['Section']['Key'])  # Value\nprint(config['Section']['key'])  # Value（也工作，自动小写）\n\n# 保持大小写\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser()\nconfig.optionxform = str  # 保持原样\n```\n\n**多文件合并**：\n```python\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser()\nconfig.read(['config.ini', 'override.ini'])\n# 后面的文件覆盖前面\n```\n\n**环境变量替换**：\n```python\nimport os\n\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser(os.environ)\n# 引用环境变量：%(HOME)s\n```\n\n**严格模式**：\n```python\n# 严格模式下，重复 section 抛错\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser(strict=True)\ntry:\n    config.read('config.ini')\nexcept configparser.DuplicateSectionError as e:\n    print(f'重复 section: {e}')\n```\n\n**读取字符串（不是文件）**：\n```python\nconfig_string = \"\"\"\n[server]\nhost = localhost\nport = 8000\n\"\"\"\n\nconfig = configparser.ConfigParser()\nconfig.read_string(config_string)\n```\n\n**生产实践**：\n- **配置文件**：config.ini\n- **敏感信息**：环境变量或 Vault\n- **多环境**：base.ini + dev.ini + prod.ini\n- **类型转换**：用 getint/getfloat/getboolean\n- **必填检查**：手动 raise if not config.has_option()"),
    ("Python 的 enum 模块怎么用？和普通类的区别？",
     "**enum** 提供枚举类型，一组具名常量。\n\n**基本用法**：\n```python\nfrom enum import Enum\n\nclass Color(Enum):\n    RED = 1\n    GREEN = 2\n    BLUE = 3\n\n# 使用\nprint(Color.RED)        # Color.RED\nprint(Color.RED.value)  # 1\nprint(Color.RED.name)   # 'RED'\n\n# 比较\nColor.RED == Color.RED  # True（同一对象）\nColor.RED == 1          # False（不能直接比较）\nColor.RED is Color.RED  # True\n```\n\n**遍历**：\n```python\nfor color in Color:\n    print(f'{color.name} = {color.value}')\n\n# 反向查找\nprint(Color(1))  # Color.RED\n```\n\n**auto() 自动赋值**：\n```python\nfrom enum import Enum, auto\n\nclass Status(Enum):\n    PENDING = auto()\n    RUNNING = auto()\n    COMPLETED = auto()\n    # 1, 2, 3\n```\n\n**别名（相同值）**：\n```python\nclass HttpStatus(Enum):\n    OK = 200\n    NOT_FOUND = 404\n    NOT_FOUND_ALT = 404  # NOT_FOUND 的别名\n\nprint(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND.value)  # 404\nprint(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND_ALT.value)  # 404\nprint(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND is HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND_ALT)  # True\n```\n\n**IntEnum（自动转换）**：\n```python\nfrom enum import IntEnum\n\nclass Priority(IntEnum):\n    LOW = 1\n    MEDIUM = 5\n    HIGH = 10\n\nprint(Priority.HIGH == 10)  # True（与 int 比较）\n```\n\n**StrEnum**：\n```python\nfrom enum import Enum\n\n# 手动实现 str-enum\nclass Status(str, Enum):\n    PENDING = 'pending'\n    RUNNING = 'running'\n    DONE = 'done'\n\nprint(Status.PENDING == 'pending')  # True\n```\n\n**Flag 枚举（位运算）**：\n```python\nfrom enum import Flag, auto\n\nclass Permission(Flag):\n    READ = auto()       # 1\n    WRITE = auto()      # 2\n    EXECUTE = auto()   # 4\n    ALL = READ | WRITE | EXECUTE  # 7\n\n# 组合\nuser_perms = Permission.READ | Permission.WRITE\nprint(user_perms & Permission.READ)  # Permission.READ\nprint(Permission.ALL in user_perms)  # False（没 EXECUTE）\n```\n\n**常用方法**：\n```python\nclass Color(Enum):\n    RED = 1\n    GREEN = 2\n    BLUE = 3\n\n# 名称 → 值\nColor['RED']  # Color.RED\n\n# 值 → 名称\nColor(1).name  # 'RED'\n\n# 数量\nlen(Color)  # 3\n\n# 包含\nColor.RED in Color  # True\n```\n\n**与函数配合**：\n```python\nfrom enum import Enum\n\nclass Command(Enum):\n    START = 'start'\n    STOP = 'stop'\n\ndef execute(cmd: Command):\n    match cmd:\n        case Command.START:\n            print('Starting')\n        case Command.STOP:\n            print('Stopping')\n```\n\n**JSON 序列化**：\n```python\nimport json\nfrom enum import Enum\n\n# 自定义 JSON 编码\nclass Color(Enum):\n    RED = 1\n    GREEN = 2\n\ndef encode(obj):\n    if isinstance(obj, Enum):\n        return {'__enum__': obj.name, 'value': obj.value}\n    raise TypeError(f'Unknown type: {type(obj)}')\n\n# 解码\ndef decode(d):\n    if '__enum__' in d:\n        return Color[d['__enum__']]\n    return d\n\ncolor = Color.RED\njson_str = json.dumps(color, default=encode)  # {\"__enum__\": \"RED\", \"value\": 1}\n```\n\n**数据库映射**：\n```python\nfrom enum import Enum\n\nclass UserRole(Enum):\n    ADMIN = 'admin'\n    USER = 'user'\n    GUEST = 'guest'\n\n# 存储（用 .value）\ndb.execute('INSERT INTO users (role) VALUES (?)', UserRole.ADMIN.value)\n\n# 读取\nrole_value = db.fetchone()\nrole = UserRole(role_value)  # 还原枚举\n```\n\n**生产实践**：\n- 状态机用 enum（清晰）\n- 配置选项用 enum（避免拼写错误）\n- API 响应码用 IntEnum\n- 权限用 Flag 枚举\n- 序列化自定义 encoder/decoder"),
    ("Python 的 typing.Protocol 怎么用？实际应用有哪些？",
     "**Protocol** 是结构化类型（鸭子类型的静态版本）。\n\n**基本用法**：\n```python\nfrom typing import Protocol\n\nclass Drawable(Protocol):\n    def draw(self) -> None: ...\n\n# 任何有 draw() 方法的对象都满足\nclass Circle:\n    def draw(self) -> None: pass\n\n# 类型检查器（mypy）\ncircle: Drawable = Circle()  # [v]\n```\n\n**@runtime_checkable**：\n```python\nfrom typing import Protocol, runtime_checkable\n\n@runtime_checkable\nclass Drawable(Protocol):\n    def draw(self) -> None: ...\n\n# 运行时检查\nisinstance(Circle(), Drawable)  # True\nisinstance(123, Drawable)  # False\n```\n\n**Protocol vs ABC**：\n\n| 维度 | Protocol | ABC |\n|---|---|---|\n| 类型 | 结构化 | 显式 |\n| 继承 | 不需要 | 必须 |\n| 适用 | 第三方类 | 自己设计 |\n| isinstance | @runtime_checkable | 自动 |\n\n**实际应用 1：测试 Mock**：\n```python\nfrom typing import Protocol\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock\n\nclass HttpClient(Protocol):\n    def get(self, url: str) -> dict: ...\n    def post(self, url: str, data: dict) -> dict: ...\n\n# Mock 自动满足（结构化类型）\ndef test_api(client: HttpClient):\n    response = client.get('/api')\n    assert response['status'] == 'ok'\n\ntest_api(Mock())  # [v]（mypy 不会报）\n```\n\n**实际应用 2：插件系统**：\n```python\nclass Plugin(Protocol):\n    def name(self) -> str: ...\n    def execute(self, data: dict) -> dict: ...\n\n# 用户实现\nclass MyPlugin:\n    def name(self) -> str: return 'my_plugin'\n    def execute(self, data: dict) -> dict:\n        return {'result': data}\n\n# 注册\nplugins: list[Plugin] = [MyPlugin()]  # mypy 接受\n```\n\n**实际应用 3：依赖注入**：\n```python\nclass Database(Protocol):\n    def query(self, sql: str) -> list: ...\n    def execute(self, sql: str) -> None: ...\n\nclass UserService:\n    def __init__(self, db: Database):\n        self.db = db\n    \n    def get_user(self, id: int):\n        return self.db.query(f'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = {id}')\n\n# 测试时\nclass MockDB:\n    def query(self, sql): return [{'id': 1, 'name': 'Test'}]\n    def execute(self, sql): pass\n\nservice = UserService(MockDB())  # [v]\n```\n\n**实际应用 4：回调类型**：\n```python\nfrom typing import Protocol, TypeVar\n\nT = TypeVar('T')\n\nclass Handler(Protocol[T]):\n    def __call__(self, value: T) -> None: ...\n\ndef process(handler: Handler[int]) -> None:\n    handler(42)\n\n# 任何可调用的对象满足\nprocess(print)\nprocess(lambda x: print(f'Got {x}'))\n```\n\n**实际应用 5：可迭代对象**：\n```python\nclass Container(Protocol[T]):\n    def __iter__(self) -> Iterator[T]: ...\n    def __len__(self) -> int: ...\n\ndef process(items: Container[str]) -> None:\n    for item in items:\n        print(item)\n\n# list, tuple, dict 都满足\nprocess(['a', 'b'])\nprocess({'k': 'v'})  # dict 也可迭代\n```\n\n**生产实践**：\n- **库 API**：用 Protocol 接受任意实现\n- **测试**：Mock 自动满足\n- **依赖注入**：通过 Protocol 抽象\n- **避免 ABC 继承**（更灵活）"),
    ("Python 中 set 和 frozenset 有什么区别？",
     "**set 和 frozenset** 都是无序唯一集合，但可变性不同。\n\n**set（可变）**：\n```python\ns = {1, 2, 3}\ns.add(4)        # {1, 2, 3, 4}\ns.remove(1)     # {2, 3, 4}\ns.discard(5)    # 不报错（不存在时不抛错）\ns.update({5, 6})  # {2, 3, 4, 5, 6}\n```\n\n**frozenset（不可变）**：\n```python\nfs = frozenset([1, 2, 3])\nfs.add(4)  # AttributeError\n```\n\n**核心区别**：\n\n| 维度 | set | frozenset |\n|---|---|---|\n| 可变 | [v] | ✗ |\n| 可哈希 | ✗ | [v] |\n| 可作 dict key | ✗ | [v] |\n| 内存 | 稍大 | 稍小（不可变） |\n| 创建 | `{1, 2}` | `frozenset([1, 2])` |\n\n**frozenset 作为 dict key**：\n```python\n# [v]\ncache = {frozenset([1, 2]): 'value_a', frozenset([3, 4]): 'value_b'}\nprint(cache[frozenset([1, 2])])  # 'value_a'\n```\n\n**set 操作（丰富）**：\n```python\na = {1, 2, 3}\nb = {2, 3, 4}\n\n# 集合操作\na | b          # {1, 2, 3, 4} 并集\na & b          # {2, 3} 交集\na - b          # {1} 差集\na ^ b          # {1, 4} 对称差\n\n# 比较\na < b          # 真子集\na <= b         # 子集\na == b         # 相等\n\n# 修改（in place）\na |= b         # a = a | b\na &= b         # a = a & b\n```\n\n**Set Comprehension**：\n```python\nnums = [1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3]\nunique = {x for x in nums}  # {1, 2, 3}\nunique_squares = {x**2 for x in nums}  # {1, 4, 9}\n```\n\n**set 性能**：\n```python\n# 成员检查 O(1)\n1000 in large_set  # 快\n\n# list 成员检查 O(n)\n1000 in large_list  # 慢\n```\n\n**set vs dict 关系**：\n- set：只有 key 的 dict\n- dict：key-value 集合\n\n```python\n# 两者底层实现相同（哈希表）\n```\n\n**常见使用场景**：\n\n**1. 去重**：\n```python\nids = [1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3]\nunique_ids = list(set(ids))  # [1, 2, 3]（顺序丢失）\n```\n\n**2. 集合运算**：\n```python\nuser_tags = {'python', 'ml', 'web'}\nrequired_tags = {'python', 'ml'}\nif required_tags.issubset(user_tags):\n    print('User has all required tags')\n```\n\n**3. 快速查找**：\n```python\nvalid_ids = {1, 5, 10, 15}\nif user_id in valid_ids:  # O(1)\n    process()\n```\n\n**4. 缓存键**：\n```python\ncache = {}\ndef fib(n):\n    if n in cache: return cache[n]\n    # ...\n```\n\n**5. 找出不同项**：\n```python\nlist1 = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\nlist2 = [3, 4, 5, 6, 7]\nonly_in_list1 = set(list1) - set(list2)  # {1, 2}\n```\n\n**frozenset 的额外用途**：\n```python\n# 1. 字典的 key（必须不可变）\ngraph = {\n    frozenset(['A', 'B']): 5,  # 边的权重\n    frozenset(['B', 'C']): 3,\n}\n\n# 2. set 的元素（set 的元素必须可哈希）\nset_of_sets = {frozenset({1, 2}), frozenset({3, 4})}\n```\n\n**生产实践**：\n- 频繁查找用 set（O(1)）\n- 不变集合用 frozenset（节省内存，可哈希）\n- 集合运算直观（数学操作）\n- 大数据先去重（节省存储）"),
    ("Python 中的 bisect 模块怎么用？二分查找的标准实现",
     "**bisect** 提供二分查找和插入到有序列表的函数。\n\n**核心函数**：\n```python\nimport bisect\n\n# 假设已排序的列表\nnums = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9]\n\n# 1. bisect_left / bisect_right\n# 找插入位置，保持有序\ni = bisect.bisect_left(nums, 5)   # 2（在已有 5 的左侧）\ni = bisect.bisect_right(nums, 5)  # 3（在已有 5 的右侧）\n```\n\n**insort（插入并保持有序）**：\n```python\nnums = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9]\nbisect.insort(nums, 6)  # [1, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9]\nbisect.insort(nums, 3)  # [1, 3, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9]\nbisect.insort(nums, 5)  # 左侧或右侧（参数 lo/hi 控制）\n```\n\n**示例：成绩排名**：\n```python\nscores = [60, 75, 80, 85, 90, 95]\n\ndef get_rank(score):\n    \"\"\"获取排名（0-based）\"\"\"\n    idx = bisect.bisect_right(scores, score)\n    return len(scores) - idx  # 高的分排名靠前\n\nprint(get_rank(85))  # 3\nprint(get_rank(100))  # 0（超过所有）\nprint(get_rank(50))   # 6（低于所有）\n```\n\n**实际应用：维护有序列表（O(log n) 插入）**：\n```python\nclass Leaderboard:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.scores = []  # 保持降序\n    \n    def add_score(self, score):\n        # 找到第一个 <= score 的位置\n        idx = bisect.bisect_left(self.scores, -score)  # 负数实现降序\n        self.scores.insert(idx, -score)\n    \n    def top_n(self, n):\n        return [-s for s in self.scores[:n]]\n\nlb = Leaderboard()\nfor s in [85, 92, 78, 95, 88]:\n    lb.add_score(s)\nprint(lb.top_n(3))  # [95, 92, 88]\n```\n\n**二分查找实现**：\n```python\ndef binary_search(arr, target):\n    \"\"\"返回 target 的索引，不存在返回 -1.\"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    return -1\n\nprint(binary_search([1, 3, 5, 7, 9], 5))  # 2\n```\n\n**bisect.bisect = bisect_right（默认）**：\n```python\n# alias\nbisect.bisect == bisect.bisect_right  # True\n```\n\n**带 lo/hi 限制（范围搜索）**：\n```python\nnums = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9]\n# 在 nums[1:4] 中查找\nidx = bisect.bisect_left(nums, 5, lo=1, hi=4)\n```\n\n**Cmpfunc 关键字（3.10+）**：\n```python\n# 自定义比较（用于复杂 key）\nimport bisect\n\nclass Person:\n    def __init__(self, name, age):\n        self.name = name\n        self.age = age\n\n# 自定义 key 函数\npeople = [Person('Alice', 30), Person('Bob', 25)]\nbisect.insort(people, Person('Carol', 28), key=lambda p: p.age)\n```\n\n**有序列表的常见用途**：\n```python\n# 1. 时间线（按时间戳）\nevents = []  # 已排序\ndef add_event(event):\n    bisect.insort(events, event, key=lambda e: e.timestamp)\n\n# 2. 任务调度（按优先级）\ntasks = []  # 已排序\ndef add_task(task):\n    bisect.insort(tasks, task, key=lambda t: t.priority)\n\n# 3. 时间窗口（滑动窗口）\ndef sliding_window_max(nums, k):\n    \"\"\"O(n log k) 解法\"\"\"\n    window = []\n    result = []\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        bisect.insort(window, (num, i))\n        if i >= k:\n            # 移除超出窗口的\n            old_idx = bisect.bisect_left(window, (nums[i - k], i - k))\n            window.pop(old_idx)\n        if i >= k - 1:\n            result.append(window[-1][0])\n    return result\n```\n\n**性能对比**：\n```python\nimport bisect\nimport time\n\nsize = 100000\nimport random\narr = sorted(random.sample(range(size * 10), size))\n\n# bisect.bisect_left\nstart = time.time()\nfor _ in range(1000):\n    bisect.bisect_left(arr, random.randint(0, size * 10))\nprint(f'bisect: {time.time() - start:.4f}s')\n\n# in 操作（线性扫描）\nstart = time.time()\nfor _ in range(1000):\n    random.randint(0, size * 10) in arr\nprint(f'in list: {time.time() - start:.4f}s')\n\n# bisect 快 100x+\n```\n\n**生产实践**：\n- 大量插入+保持有序：用 bisect（O(log n)）\n- 排名/分位数计算\n- 时间窗口\n- IP/范围查找\n- 配合 heapq 实现 top-k"),
    ("Python 中 deque 的内部实现和性能特点是什么？",
     "**deque**（双端队列）是 collections 模块的高效数据结构。\n\n**内部实现**：\n- **双向链表 + 数组**：O(1) 两端操作\n- **block-based**：deque 由多个 block 组成\n- CPython 实现：`_Py_double_list` 结构\n\n**vs list**：\n```python\n# list（动态数组）\n# - append/pop 末尾：O(1) 均摊\n# - insert/pop 中间：O(n)\n\n# deque（双向链表）\n# - append/pop 两端：O(1)\n# - insert/pop 中间：O(n)\n```\n\n**时间复杂度对比**：\n\n| 操作 | list | deque |\n|---|---|---|\n| `append()` | O(1) | O(1) |\n| `pop()`（末尾）| O(1) | O(1) |\n| `pop(0)`（开头）| O(n) | O(1) |\n| `appendleft()` | O(n) | O(1) |\n| `insert(i, x)` | O(n) | O(n) |\n| `[i]` 索引 | O(1) | O(1) |\n\n**基本使用**：\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndq = deque()\n\n# 末尾操作\ndq.append(1)        # [1]\ndq.append(2)        # [1, 2]\ndq.pop()            # 2，[1]\n\n# 开头操作\ndq.appendleft(0)    # [0, 1]\ndq.popleft()        # 0，[1]\n\n# 限制长度（自动丢弃）\ndq = deque(maxlen=3)\ndq.extend([1, 2, 3, 4, 5])\n# deque([3, 4, 5])，旧的被丢弃\n```\n\n**使用场景**：\n\n**1. 队列（FIFO）**：\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\nqueue = deque()\nqueue.append('task1')  # 入队\nqueue.append('task2')\nqueue.popleft()        # 'task1'（出队）\n```\n\n**2. 栈（LIFO）**：\n```python\nstack = deque()\nstack.append('a')     # ['a']\nstack.append('b')     # ['a', 'b']\nstack.pop()            # 'b'，['a']\n```\n\n**3. 滑动窗口**：\n```python\n# 滑动窗口最大值\ndef max_sliding_window(nums, k):\n    dq = deque()  # 存索引\n    result = []\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        # 移除超出窗口的\n        while dq and dq[0] < i - k + 1:\n            dq.popleft()\n        # 维护单调递减\n        while dq and nums[dq[-1]] < num:\n            dq.pop()\n        dq.append(i)\n        if i >= k - 1:\n            result.append(nums[dq[0]])\n    return result\n```\n\n**4. BFS（广度优先）**：\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef bfs(graph, start):\n    visited = {start}\n    queue = deque([start])\n    while queue:\n        node = queue.popleft()\n        for neighbor in graph[node]:\n            if neighbor not in visited:\n                visited.add(neighbor)\n                queue.append(neighbor)\n    return visited\n```\n\n**5. 撤销栈（编辑器）**：\n```python\nundo_stack = deque()\nundo_stack.append(('add', 'hello'))\nundo_stack.append(('delete', 'world'))\nundo_stack.pop()  # 最近的操作\n```\n\n**6. 限流（滑动窗口）**：\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\nimport time\n\nclass RateLimiter:\n    def __init__(self, max_calls, period):\n        self.max_calls = max_calls\n        self.period = period\n        self.calls = deque()\n    \n    def allow(self):\n        now = time.time()\n        # 移除窗口外的\n        while self.calls and self.calls[0] < now - self.period:\n            self.calls.popleft()\n        if len(self.calls) < self.max_calls:\n            self.calls.append(now)\n            return True\n        return False\n\n# 每秒最多 10 次\nlimiter = RateLimiter(10, 1.0)\n```\n\n**7. 任务队列（生产者-消费者）**：\n```python\nqueue = deque(maxlen=1000)\n\n# 生产者\ndef producer():\n    while True:\n        item = produce()\n        queue.append(item)\n\n# 消费者\ndef consumer():\n    while True:\n        if queue:\n            item = queue.popleft()\n            process(item)\n```\n\n**8. 滑动窗口（最近 N 个）**：\n```python\n# 维护最近 100 次请求\nrecent = deque(maxlen=100)\nfor req in requests:\n    recent.append(req)\n    avg = sum(recent) / len(recent)\n```\n\n**扩展方法**：\n```python\ndq = deque([1, 2, 3, 4, 5])\n\n# 旋转\ndq.rotate(2)  # deque([4, 5, 1, 2, 3])\ndq.rotate(-1)  # 反向旋转\n\n# 限制\ndq.clear()\ndq.count(2)  # 出现次数\n```\n\n**deque vs 其他队列**：\n\n| 库 | 特性 | 适合 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `collections.deque` | 标准库、O(1) 两端 | 通用队列/栈 |\n| `queue.Queue` | 线程安全、阻塞 | 多线程队列 |\n| `multiprocessing.Queue` | 跨进程 | 多进程通信 |\n| `asyncio.Queue` | 异步 | 异步队列 |\n| `heapq` | 优先队列 | 任务调度 |\n\n**生产实践**：\n- 队列/栈场景：deque\n- 滑动窗口：deque + maxlen\n- BFS/DFS：deque\n- 多线程：queue.Queue（线程安全）\n- 异步：asyncio.Queue"),
    ("Python 中 typing 模块的 TypeVarTuple 怎么用？（Python 3.11+）",
     "**TypeVarTuple**（PEP 646）是 Python 3.11+ 引入，支持变长泛型参数。\n\n**基本用法**：\n```python\nfrom typing import TypeVarTuple, Generic, Unpack\n\nTs = TypeVarTuple('Ts')\n\n# 变长泛型函数\ndef first(*args: Unpack[Ts]) -> tuple[Unpack[Ts]]:\n    return args\n\n# TypeScript\nresult = first(1, 'a', 3.14)\n# 类型：tuple[int, str, float]\n```\n\n**Generic 类**：\n```python\nclass Tuple(Generic[Unpack[Ts]]):\n    def __init__(self, *items: Unpack[Ts]):\n        self.items = items\n    def first(self) -> Unpack[Ts]:\n        return self.items[0]\n\nt = Tuple(1, 'a', 3.14)\n# 类型：Tuple[int, str, float]\n```\n\n**解包到多个 TypeVar**：\n```python\nT1 = TypeVar('T1')\nT2 = TypeVar('T2')\nT3 = TypeVar('T3')\n\ndef split_args(\n    a: T1,\n    b: T2,\n    c: T3\n) -> tuple[T1, T2, T3]:\n    return (a, b, c)\n\nx, y, z = split_args(1, 'hello', 3.14)\n# x: int, y: str, z: float\n```\n\n**Unpack 操作符**：\n```python\n# 解包 tuple / list\ndef process(items: tuple[int, ...]): ...\n\n# 实际：Unpack[Ts] 表示变长参数\nTs = TypeVarTuple('Ts')\n\ndef process(*args: Unpack[Ts]) -> Unpack[Ts]:\n    return args\n```\n\n**实际应用 1：tuple 类型**：\n```python\nfrom typing import TypeVarTuple, Unpack, Generic\n\nTs = TypeVarTuple('Ts')\n\n# 通用 tuple 包装\nclass TypedTuple(Generic[Unpack[Ts]]):\n    def __init__(self, *items: Unpack[Ts]):\n        self.items = items\n    \n    def head(self) -> Unpack[Ts]:\n        return self.items[0]\n\n# 错误！Unpack 不能在 return 单独使用\n# def bad() -> Unpack[Ts]: ...\n```\n\n**实际应用 2：解构**：\n```python\nT1 = TypeVar('T1')\nT2 = TypeVar('T2')\nT3 = TypeVar('T3')\n\n# 类似 Haskell 的模式匹配\ndef first_and_second(\n    first: T1,\n    second: T2,\n    *rest: Unpack[T3]\n) -> tuple[T1, T2, Unpack[T3]]:\n    return (first, second) + rest\n```\n\n**实际应用 3：装饰器**：\n```python\nfrom typing import ParamSpec, TypeVarTuple, Unpack, Callable\n\nP = ParamSpec('P')\nTs = TypeVarTuple('Ts')\nR = TypeVar('R')\n\ndef log_and_call(\n    func: Callable[P, R],\n    *args: P.args,\n    **kwargs: P.kwargs\n) -> R:\n    print(f'Calling {func.__name__}')\n    return func(*args, **kwargs)\n```\n\n**实际应用 4：Tuple 类型映射**：\n```python\nfrom typing import TypeVarTuple, Unpack\n\nTs = TypeVarTuple('Ts')\n\ndef make_tuple(*args: Unpack[Ts]) -> tuple[Unpack[Ts]]:\n    return args\n\n# 显式类型注解\ndef pair() -> tuple[int, str]:\n    return make_tuple(1, 'hello')  # OK\n```\n\n**对比 TypeVar**：\n```python\n# TypeVar（每个位置相同类型）\nT = TypeVar('T')\ndef first(items: list[T]) -> T: ...  # list[T] 中所有元素同类型\n\n# TypeVarTuple（每个位置可不同类型）\nTs = TypeVarTuple('Ts')\ndef first(*args: Unpack[Ts]) -> Unpack[Ts]: ...  # 不同位置可不同\n```\n\n**Python 3.12+ 简化（type 关键字）**：\n```python\n# 3.12+ 简化泛型\ntype Vector[T] = list[T]\ntype Pair[A, B] = tuple[A, B]\n```\n\n**Python 3.11+ 限制**：\n- Unpack 不能单独使用（必须配合 Generic 或 Callable）\n- 性能略低（typing 模块开销）\n\n**生产实践**：\n- 3.11+ 项目可大胆使用\n- 老 Python 版本需 Unpack 兼容\n- 关键库内部使用（API 友好）\n- 复杂泛型场景才用（避免过度设计）"),
]

